WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.007
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.177
( whistling )

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.332
<i> ( music continues )</i>

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.824
( Tarzan yell )

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.359
( grunts )
All right, we're in.

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:01.761
You know the plan, right?

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:03.729
What am I saying?
You practically wrote it.

00:01:03.762 --> 00:01:05.331
Everything you need is
in your bag,

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:08.701
so let's synchronize
our watches on three.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.470
Three! Perfect.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.539
Now, stick to the plan
and you'll be just fine.

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:17.410
But if you deviate from it
for even a single moment,

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.278
I won't come back for you.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.380
Okay? Good luck!

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:22.415
( grunts )

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.559
Hey!

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:35.394
What do you think
you're doing?

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:36.496 align:start size:50% position:50%
Oh, no!

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:37.897 align:start size:75% position:25%
Not the old steak trick.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.732
I'm not falling for that twice.

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:41.200 align:start size:78% position:22%
Yeah, put the steak down.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:42.468 align:start size:75% position:25%
I'm not even gonna look
at the steak.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.403
I'm looking at you
right in the eyes.

00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:45.538
I looked at the steak.

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:47.540 align:start size:38% position:63%
Shh.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.909
Nicely done, buddy.

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:52.411
All according to plan.

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:53.746
And speaking of plan,

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:56.582
looks like we are, uh,

00:01:56.615 --> 00:01:58.751
eh, yeah.

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.720
We're moving on to phase two.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.723
Are you ready? On my go.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.258
Go!

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.160
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:12.598 align:start position:0%
Behind you. Behind you.

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:14.701
( man whistling )

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:19.438
He tracks the intruder,

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:21.941
quiet as a ninja
suppressing a fart in church.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:23.943
( chuckles )
There she is.

00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:26.913
Three-legged woman,
got you now.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:29.448 align:start position:0%
Oh, this?
It's just my gun.

00:02:29.481 --> 00:02:31.951 size:84% position:42%
You're safe with me, ma'am.

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.452 align:start position:0%
( muttering, shouts )

00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:35.188 align:start position:0%
I mean, who's there?

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.322 align:start size:31% position:69%
Come back!

00:02:38.757 --> 00:02:40.827
Great job, buddy.
I'll meet you over there.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.840
All right.
We are so close to the vault.

00:02:54.873 --> 00:02:57.877
Come on.
Stay low and stay quiet.

00:02:59.278 --> 00:03:01.247
Come on, this way.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.582
We're almost there.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.517
Checkmate.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.553
- Okay. Oh, I can
  almost taste it.
- ( lock beeps )

00:03:08.787 --> 00:03:10.656
You wanna know my favorite thing
about this vault?

00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:12.458 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Go on.
- You need two keys.

00:03:12.491 --> 00:03:14.660
- One for you, one for me.
- All right, here we go.

00:03:14.693 --> 00:03:18.531 align:start size:91% position:9%
- Ready? One, two, three.
- Both: Security!

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:19.999
( alarm chirps )

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:22.235 align:start position:0%
I love this job.

00:03:23.702 --> 00:03:27.506
Oh, crap. Oh, crap.

00:03:27.539 --> 00:03:28.975
This wasn't in the plans.

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.843
There are two keys
for this vault.

00:03:30.876 --> 00:03:33.512
We need to get them from
those guards or any guards

00:03:33.545 --> 00:03:35.848
that are moderately
less competent than those.

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:37.550
Why don't you go back
the way we came

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:39.986
and why don't I have
a little bit of a chat

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:41.654
with that guard over there.

00:03:41.687 --> 00:03:42.722
Be back in a flash.

00:03:47.526 --> 00:03:49.529
- ( clang )
- Aah! Oh!

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:56.369
Be back in a flash.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.370 align:start position:0%
( clicks tongue )

00:03:57.403 --> 00:04:00.306
( snorting )

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:04.410
( snarls )

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:08.414
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:15.788 align:start size:75% position:25%
- ( clang )
- ( screaming )

00:04:17.756 --> 00:04:19.525
Okay.

00:04:19.558 --> 00:04:20.559
Ooh!

00:04:20.592 --> 00:04:22.528
Oh, you got a key.

00:04:22.561 --> 00:04:24.397
I got one, too. Come on.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:26.899 align:start position:0%
I think these are what
we need to get in that vault.

00:04:26.932 --> 00:04:28.601 align:start position:0%
Oh, boy.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.737 align:start position:0%
Oh, this is it.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.906 align:start position:0%
You ready?
Now on three.

00:04:33.939 --> 00:04:35.908 align:start size:69% position:31%
- One--
- ( buzzer )

00:04:35.941 --> 00:04:37.576 align:start position:0%
What the hell?
Ah, whatever.

00:04:37.609 --> 00:04:38.577
( buzzer )

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.580 align:start position:0%
After you.

00:04:41.613 --> 00:04:42.849
( alarm chirps )

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:48.487 align:start position:0%
Oh, this is it.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.523 align:start position:0%
This is really it.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.996
- ( glass shatters )
- This is what we've
  been working towards

00:04:57.029 --> 00:04:58.597 align:start position:0%
all those years.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.799 align:start position:0%
It's finally ours.

00:05:02.101 --> 00:05:06.439
This is gonna change
our lives forever.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.441 align:start size:81% position:19%
- ( alarm blaring )
- Ah, crap.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:09.942
Um, it's fine.

00:05:09.975 --> 00:05:12.111
Uh, this is why we plan.

00:05:12.144 --> 00:05:14.447
Oh! Okay, I see two ways
out of here.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.082 align:start size:66% position:34%
There just so happens
to be a sewer

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:18.451 align:start size:59% position:41%
that runs directly
beneath this vault.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:21.454
I supposed we could've
gone in that way,
but that doesn't matter.

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:23.556
We could either go through
the sewer all sneaky like,

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:26.959
or we could go out
guns blazing.

00:05:26.992 --> 00:05:28.627
Yeah, I found these bad boys

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.962
in the pirate exhibit
on the way over here,

00:05:29.995 --> 00:05:31.464
but we gotta choose fast.

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:32.631
I think they're on the way

00:05:32.664 --> 00:05:33.799
and they're not
gonna be friendly

00:05:33.832 --> 00:05:35.468
when we're in here
with the box

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.036
and the bomb and the gun.

00:05:37.069 --> 00:05:38.804
So, either one's good.

00:05:38.837 --> 00:05:40.473
Sewer will probably work
all quiet like,

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:43.476
but, you know,
I like a little action.

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:45.678
But stealth is good, too.

